  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.3.0: Redesigned license UI — products now render as grouped cards (replacing the dropdown), with a developer-selectable layout (Bands / Lanes / Switcher) and per-card status, validity meter and actions. Group products via LicenseViewModel.ApplyGrouping(...) or the App.config <ProductGroups> / licenseLayout settings. Register / Unregister / Error dialogs restyled to match. Validity meter is now based on the real license period (subscription term / trial window / file validity). A check that returns Unknown shows a distinct \"Unverified\" state instead of looking unloaded. Existing LicenseViewModel.License / FromContext usage is unchanged.",
